@startuml
!include ../../../../../tooling/styles/plantuml/c4/context-diagram-style.iuml
title Context | Proposed agent harness
actor "User" as U
actor "E-08 Approval operator" as A
rectangle "SYS-01 Agent harness\n[Software system]" as H
rectangle "E-06 Model provider\n[External system]" as M
rectangle "E-07 Tool/resource service\n[External system]" as T
U --> H : submits task / HTTPS
A --> H : approves scoped intent / HTTPS
H --> M : requests proposal / HTTPS
H --> T : invokes authorized resource / protocol-specific
legend bottom
Directed arrow = initiating interaction; nesting = stated logical or deployment boundary.
Status: proposed, not implementation evidence.
endlegend
@enduml
